@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Dataset Gates And Audits - Detail

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
top to bottom direction

artifact "Row decisions" as Rows
[Near-duplicate gate] as Dedupe
[Source-balance gate] as Balance
[Category + difficulty audit] as Distribution
[Taxonomy coverage audit] as Taxonomy
artifact "Final decisions" as Final

Rows --> Dedupe : can change status
Dedupe --> Balance : can change status
Balance --> Distribution : report only
Distribution --> Taxonomy : report only
Taxonomy --> Final

@enduml
